超回城后，杨氏与马超三子皆被杀害。","tc":"馬超之妻，與王異為好友。馬超前往平定韋康部下楊阜等人反叛時，馬超妻兒被其籠絡的梁寬所挾持，馬超回城后，楊氏與馬超三子皆被殺害。","en":"Wife of Ma Chao and a good friend of Wang Yi. When Ma Chao left to suppress the rebellion of Yang Fu and other former subordinates of Wei Kang, his wife and children were seized by Liang Kuan, whom they had won over. After Ma Chao returned to the city, Lady Yang and Ma Chao's three sons were all killed.","jp":"馬超の妻で、王異とは親友であった。馬超が韋康の配下である楊阜らの反乱平定に向かった際、馬超の妻子は楊阜らに籠絡された梁寛に捕らえられた。馬超が帰城したのち、楊氏と馬超の三人の子は皆殺害された。","kr":"마초의 아내이자 왕이의 친구였다. 마초가 위강의 부하인 양부 등의 반란을 평정하러 갔을 때, 마초의 처자는 양부에게 포섭된 양관에게 인질로 잡혔으며, 마초가 성으로 돌아온 뒤 양씨와 마초의 세 아들은 모두 살해당했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10255","remark":"","surname":"杨","surnameTc":"楊","surnameEn":"Yang","surnameJp":"楊","surnameKr":"양","surnameOther":"","name":"氏","nameTc":"氏","nameEn":"Shi","nameJp":"氏","nameKr":"씨","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"杨氏","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"188","city":"CS1032","gender":"1","rule":"61","force":"64","wise":"64","politics":"61","charm":"87","will":"72","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"6","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"13","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"6/6/6/78/6/17/78/6","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1001205","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4000","battleSoulPoint":"4000","debateSoulPoint":"4000","strategy":"","strategy2":"1004801","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/0/0/1/3/1/0/0/0/5/0/0/1/0/0/3/0/1/4/0","attribute2":"71/70/74/70/87/78","morality":"4","compatible":"46","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","evaluate":"3000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"175","show":"188","death":"214","age":"0","injury":